# chili input v1: sample buttons x y
# The settings inside the game, worked by a pad from the game's own menus (replays/README.md, "settings_tour.replay").
# Only with CHILI_PAGE=1 and CHILI_CONFIG=<a copy of scripts/unattended.ini>; stop at frame 1915. What each press is for:
#   170: main menu: Down x3 = the Settings line
#   250: Cross on Settings: the page opens (menu frame)
#   270: Display
#   290: Resolution one step: waits for a restart
#   310: Frame rate: waits for a restart
#   330: Show frames early flipped
#   360: Graphics
#   370: Quality one step
#   400: Texture filter one step back (wraps)
#   430: Controls
#   490: Prompts: PSP original -> Gamepad -> Keyboard (in force at once)
#   534: Keyboard & mouse
#   544: Turn speed: Right held 30 samples (repeats), written when let go
#   614: Invert up/down flipped
#   664: Defaults: the question
#   678: Ok: the twelve rows back to their defaults
#   712: Gamepad
#   742: Invert up/down flipped (gamepad)
#   752: and back again with Right
#   782: Left dead zone: Right held
#   842: Textures & mods
#   852: Textures tried: locked, the reason for three seconds
#   876: Dump textures flipped: waits for a restart
#   906: Sound
#   916: Sound buffer one step
#   946: Circle held ten samples on the top page: the page closes, the game keeps its line
#   976: Up x3: El Gringo Loco
#   1036: El Gringo Loco: Story 1-1 loads
#   1056: Continue on the briefing
#   1076: skips the story movie
#   1096: skips the in-engine intro
#   1236: Start: the pause menu
#   1276: Down x3: Restart, Chicken out, Settings (Rewind is dark and skipped)
#   1340: Cross on Settings: the page opens in the pause box
#   1360: Display
#   1380: Resolution tried in a mission: locked, the reason
#   1424: Controls
#   1464: Gamepad
#   1474: Turn speed (gamepad): Right held, in force at once
#   1524: Invert up/down (gamepad) flipped: in force at once
#   1554: Prompts one step on (Keyboard -> Gamepad)
#   1598: Button pictures: Automatic -> Xbox -> PlayStation
#   1642: Textures & mods
#   1662: Dump textures tried in a mission
#   1696: Sound
#   1706: Sound buffer tried in a mission
#   1730: Start held ten samples: the page closes only; the pause menu stays on Settings
#   1760: Circle: Resume
